                                "sense_id": "27ad5353-9f88-3027-b523-6d16f8fe1444",
                                "text": "The inner logic of metabolism... part stems from the vicissitudes of life itself, which forced evolution down improbable paths, while transforming our geologically restless globe from a sterile, anoxic planet into the living, high-octane world of today."
